2026-09-25T00:28:49.5180614Z === format-check selftest: every refusal must be able to fire, and name itself ===
2026-09-25T00:28:49.5226336Z   ok    a missing workflow REFUSES rather than guessing a version (exit 5, names 'exit 5')
2026-09-25T00:28:49.5310866Z   ok    a matrix in a DIFFERENT job must not answer for the format job (exit 5, names 'exit 5')
2026-09-25T00:28:49.8153716Z   ok    a version mismatch REFUSES LOUDLY and is not reported as unformatted (exit 3, names 'WRONG ELIXIR')
2026-09-25T00:28:49.8154927Z   ok    and it says NO CLAIM is being made, so nothing downstream reads it as a verdict (exit 3, names 'NO CLAIM')
2026-09-25T00:28:49.8156740Z   ok    and it forbids the reflex 'fix' that would red a currently-green gate (exit 3, names 'Do NOT run')
2026-09-25T00:28:50.2815431Z   ok    unfetched deps REFUSE as themselves, not as a format failure (exit 4, names 'DEPS NOT FETCHED')
2026-09-25T00:28:50.2816294Z   ok    and the import_deps trap is named so the next reader does not re-derive it (exit 4, names 'import_deps')
2026-09-25T00:28:50.5356255Z   ok    a wrapper REFUSAL refuses as itself and is NEVER reported as unformatted (exit 6, names 'CANNOT READ')
2026-09-25T00:28:50.5357809Z   ok    and it quotes the wrapper's own words so the reader can see WHO refused (exit 6, names 'REFUSED on this box')
2026-09-25T00:28:50.5359336Z   ok    and it says NO CLAIM, so nothing downstream reads exit 6 as a verdict (exit 6, names 'NO CLAIM')
2026-09-25T00:28:50.8300405Z   ok    a wrapper refusing with exit 1 behind 200KB of output is STILL a refusal, not a verdict (exit 6, names 'CANNOT READ')
2026-09-25T00:28:51.5046653Z   ok    a FORMATTED tree still passes with the caller setting no BP_ALLOW_FORMAT (exit 0, names 'FORMAT OK')
2026-09-25T00:28:52.1926785Z   ok    an UNFORMATTED file still reds as exit 1, and not as a refusal (exit 1, names 'UNFORMATTED')
2026-09-25T00:28:52.1927667Z   ok    and the red names the file the formatter objected to (exit 1, names 'b.ex')
2026-09-25T00:28:52.1965108Z   ok    the reader resolves the REAL workflow's pin: Elixir 1.19.5
2026-09-25T00:28:52.1965658Z 
